existing notes slides; not layouts, masters, charts, SmartArt or comments). The property-based test uses
`hypothesis`, already a dev dependency. Implementation detail is in the card,
`.meta/roadmap/stages/03-hardening-and-gaps/v0.7.0.md`.

## Goals
- `TextFrame`/`_Paragraph` `replace()` and `find_all()` across run boundaries; replaced text takes the
  formatting of the first run it touches.
- Deck-wide `find_text()`/`replace_text()` on `Slide` and `Presentation`.
- `iter_runs()`/`iter_chars()` traversal, and an opt-in `merge_runs()` that ignores proofing state.

